        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-18317-21189"><seg source="#source-18317-18326">まだ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18326-18344"><rb>可笑</rb><rt>をか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18344-18350">しい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18350-18365"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18365-18386">がある、ずツと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18386-18401"><rb>後</rb><rt>あと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18401-18410">で……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18410-18422"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18422-18425">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18425-18452"><rb>番町</rb><rt>ばんちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18452-18455">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18455-18467"><rb>湯</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18467-18470">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18470-18482"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18482-18512">くと、かへりがけに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18512-18536"><rb>錢湯</rb><rt>せんたう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18536-18539">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18539-18563"><rb>亭主</rb><rt>ていしゆ</rt></ruby>が「<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18569-18605"><rb>先生々々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-18584-18596">せんせい</seg><choice source="#source-18596-18602"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18605-18608">」</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18608-18626"><rb>丁</rb><rt>ちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18626-18629">ど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18629-18644"><rb>午</rb><rt>ひる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18644-18659">ごろだから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-18659-18674"><rb>他</rb><rt>ほか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-18674-18677">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend